@J0F3 unfortunately Active Directory authentication for Storage requires non-default permissions which most users don't have; thus I believe we'll need to default to Shared Key authentication for the foreseeable future.

From our side support from this is blocked on migrating to [the Giovanni Azure Storage SDK](https://github.com/tombuildsstuff/giovanni) which @mbfrahry will be looking into - once that's done we should be able to take a look into this.

Thanks!
